# Required for production builds (all platforms).
#
# In development it's optional and, when set, overrides the per-platform
# defaults in src/lib/config.ts (localhost / 10.0.2.2). Set it to your
# machine's LAN IP when testing on a physical phone over Expo Go, e.g.:
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.42:5190
# and run the API with: dotnet run --launch-profile lan   (binds 0.0.0.0)
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
